expect glucosamine/chondroitin to treat knee osteoarthritis"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Don’t rely on vitamin C to prevent colds"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"Don’t get a whole-body PET-CT or tumor marker panel if you have no symptoms"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Don’t expect fitness trackers or smartwatches to help you lose weight"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Don’t pay a premium for organic food just to be “healthier”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Don’t spend a lot of money on health supplements, herbal formulas, or tonics to “improve your health”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Don’t take probiotics long-term if you have no gut problems"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Don’t force yourself to take cold showers just to “boost immunity”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Don’t buy products marketed for detox, colon cleansing, enzymes, or alkaline water"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Don’t force yourself to drink water just to hit “8 glasses a day”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Don’t spend money on fortune‑telling, tarot, or astrology to make decisions"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"aria-current":"page","className":"active","href":"/en/tip/06-16","data-status":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Don’t buy blue-light-blocking glasses to “protect your vision,” and don’t believe claims that staring at screens for months will ruin your eyes — but severe eye pain, redness, and swelling require immediate medical attention"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-17"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"Don’t treat blood donation as a health habit: claims that it “detoxifies, lowers cholesterol, and prevents heart attacks” lack randomized trial support, while frequent donation truly causes iron deficiency"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-18"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"Don’t rely on generic health check packages to prevent disease; instead, get the evidence‑based screenings appropriate for your age and gender"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-19"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"Don’t start taking uric‑acid‑lowering drugs just because a checkup shows high uric acid but you’ve never had symptoms"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-20"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"Don’t have a gallbladder removed prophylactically just because an ultrasound found gallstones but you’ve never felt any pain"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-21"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"Don’t cut calcium out to prevent kidney stones"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-22"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"Don’t buy crystals, bracelets, or Pixiu figurines for “good luck,” “wealth attraction,” or “health benefits”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-23"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"Don’t expect shopping to lift your mood or boost your sense of self-worth"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-24"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"Don’t spend extra money to “move up a rung” among your peers by buying a new house, car, or social circle"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/06-25